13825052,2025-06-01,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"I am writing to file a formal complaint regarding the inaccurate reporting of late payments on my credit report, as maintained by Equifax. These reported delinquencies are factually incorrect, legally indefensible, and have caused measurable harm to my creditworthiness. 

