XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX  Similar to the above, this collection account is inconsistent and unverifiable. You have not provided sufficient documentation. Delete this item or provide full evidence of its accuracy in compliance with FCRA and Metro 2 standards. 

XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX This collection account contains conflicting data across bureaus and lacks proper validation. Continued reporting without documentation violates your legal obligations. Delete this item or provide proof of accuracy. 

Inaccurate Personal Information I also dispute inaccurate personal identifiers ( names, addresses, etc. ) on my credit file. These do not belong to me and must be removed immediately under 15 U.S. Code 1681c.

Demand for Documentation I hereby request tangible evidence proving that the inquiries and entries in question were authorized and made for a permissible purpose, as required under federal law. If such evidence can not be produced, all unverified and derogatory items must be removed. 

Please consider this notice a formal demand for compliance. Failure to take corrective action will result in immediate escalation, including legal proceedings.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,"TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.",MI,48237,,Web,2025-06-04,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes
