In summary, every attempt to transfer funds out of Marcus to another account in my name has been met with obstruction, delay, and lack of transparency. The process has been excruciating. The Marcus team has been dismissive, opaque, and uncooperativeusing bureaucracy and vague references to "" security '' to stonewall access to my own money. If fraud prevention were truly the priority, they would have scrutinized the incoming transfernot just the outgoing one.

