13977398,2025-06-09,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account status incorrect,"Upon reviewing my credit report, I discovered inaccurate and damaging information concerning an account falsely marked as having a late payment. Specifically : Lendbuzz reported a late payment for XX/XX/2025. 

