14048708,2025-06-12,Debt collection,Telecommunications debt,Attempts to collect debt not owed,Debt was paid,"On XX/XX/XXXX, XXXX  XXXX XXXX ( XXXX ) responded to a formal CFPB complaint regarding a XXXX debt. XXXX acknowledged the issue and stated they would request the account be removed from the credit bureaus as a courtesy, with removal to be reflected within XXXX business days. 

