14162315,2025-06-18,Checking or savings account,Checking account,Managing an account,Deposits and withdrawals,"In XXXX of XXXX I noticed that unusual transactions had been transpiring on a joint business checking account that I shared with my partner at the time in which we both had equal access to the account. 
