To investigate further, we contacted a family member who had been expecting a payment via XXXX from a third party ( for legitimate services performed ). The sender had instructed her bank to send funds to him ; however, due to a miscommunication, the funds were mistakenly routed to our account. Unaware of the error or who the funds were sent to, her bank advised her to file a fraud claim. 

