14307464,2025-06-27,Vehicle loan or lease,Loan,Repossession,Deficiency balance after repossession,"I co-signed a car loan with my ex-partner, who stopped making payments. Due to the abusive nature of that relationship, which I disclosed to Ally in late XXXX, I went no-contact with him. Despite this, I made every effort to assist Ally in repossessing the vehicle by providing his address, locations he frequented, and later, his workplace. 

