14377931,2025-06-30,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"I am writing to formally dispute the inaccurate and inconsistent reporting of the following account on my credit reports from XXXX XXXX and Equifax : Creditor Name : XXXX Account Number : XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX  Type : Auto Loan Installment Upon reviewing my credit file, I have identified multiple violations of the Metro 2 Credit Reporting Guidelines and the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ). The reporting of this account is factually inconsistent, incomplete, and misleading for the reasons listed below : Metro 2 and FCRA Compliance Violations : Inconsistent Account Status Across Bureaus : XXXX  and XXXX  list this account as "" Repossession '' with a derogatory status. 

